|---|---|
| « requires the 'Locomotor' plugin » | `Locomotor` |
| `CharacterMover`, `NavMover`, `ConsumeNavMovementData` | `Mover` |
| « Component class is not set for 'MotionWarping' » | `MotionWarping` |
| `ConvertToBlendStackNodePure`, `ConvertToPoseHistoryNodePure` | `PoseSearch` |
| `MakeVisualLoggerDebugDrawer`, `DrawDebugGraphAxes`, `AddToFloatHistoryArray` | `DrawDebugLibrary` |
| `SetRetargetAsset` | `IKRig` |
| `SetSubject` | `PerformanceCaptureCore` |
| nœud « State Machine Blend Stack » | `BlendStack` |

Les autres, `MotionTrajectory`, `AnimationWarping`, `AnimationLocomotionLibrary`, `Chooser`,
